      "text": "• Example: CHG-001 → requirement → STORY-42 → PR #12 → checks ✓ → test run ✓ → v0.3.0 → logs → BUG-7\n• Verified links come from IDs in branches, commits, PRs, tags and tickets\n• Missing links are shown as gaps, never filled in by AI",
